      "worked_solution": "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection point of the two curves.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14190078/assets/3bb3ee0e430c4ad86f7378d21285ade9c911a2d3bb91c7d017c65e49ee630097.png)\n\nFrom the graph, the curves intersect only at $(1,3).$ Therefore, this is the solution of the corresponding system.",
